Name: ThreeME viewer
Description: Explore a ThreeME simulation result: pick variables, draw the plot, build the table, and copy out the code.
Binding: threeme_viewer
Interactive: true

Name: New ThreeME calibration
Description: Create a baseline or shock calibration script, named so that readconfig() finds it.
Binding: calib_addin
Interactive: true

Name: ThreeME configuration
Description: Fill in a ThreeME configuration, one tab per section, editing only the assignments you change.
Binding: config_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Run ThreeME simulations
Description: Launch a run: set the project name, pick the configurations, and adjust the scenarios for this run only.
Binding: run_addin
Interactive: true
